		{
			description: [
				"{image:kubejs:item/fredeggs width:50 height:50 align:center}"
				""
				"Hi! I'm your Franchised Relation for Entities Director and Efficiency Global General Supervisor. FRED EGGS for short, if you will. "
				""
				"You may have suffered a slight concussion upon landing, effectively reducing your life expectancy drastically. As such, I will request that you sign this contract immediately. This will ensure that all responsible parties are held accountable."
			]
			icon: "kubejs:contract"
			id: "12917F7EBF5D8918"
