		{
			dependencies: ["12917F7EBF5D8918"]
			description: [
				"{image:kubejs:item/fredeggs width:20 height:20 align:center}"
				""
				"In the event of your uninsured accident harming your cognitive and memory abilities, allow me to remind you of the circumstances of our agreement:"
				"&6Your goal is to build a self-sufficient Food and Beverages industry."
				"You will need to hire Villagers, feed them and help them level up to gain their &b&lSeal of Approval&r."
				"Go on, hire your first Villager!"
				""
				"&4Note: You may keep the contract and cherish it as your &lutmost&r &4precious possession.&r"
			]
			id: "18F82432598BFED0"
			rewards: [{
				id: "119A22CF9010D95A"
				item: "kubejs:villager_capsule"
				type: "item"
