		{
			dependencies: ["14EFC5F3A0624121"]
			description: [
				"{image:kubejs:item/fredeggs width:20 height:20 align:center}"
				""
				"Your villagers lack experience in their domain. You shall help them gain knowledge through consumption of food."
				"Villagers need to perform 250 trades in order to reach mastery in their craft, from whereupon you will gain access to their most succulent trade rewards. Their learning curve is as follows:"
				"1->2 with &a10&r trades"
				"2->3 with &e60&r trades (70 total)"
				"3->4 with &680&r trades (150 total)"
				"4->5 with &c100&r trades (250 total)"
				"{image:jei:textures/jei/atlas/gui/icons/arrow_next.png width:20 height:20 align:center}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"{image:kubejs:item/fredeggs width:20 height:20 align:center}"
				""
				"You may not interact in person with your Villagers, but instead use &eTrading Depots&r. You may have one — free of charge — as an encouragement to avoid social interaction that would hinder your productivity. Ponder the item for additional information if adequate cognitive abilities lack."
			]
