				"{image:kubejs:item/fredeggs width:20 height:20 align:center}"
				""
				"As per OSHA rules, The Company is legally bound to encourage you not to sollicit villager labor in inadequate Work Conditions. You may disregard these rules at your own discretion and consideration for Productivity; although be advised that &eFarmers require fields in close, reachable proximity to perform&r. Other villagers only require their workstation and a bed. You may manage living spaces accordingly. "
				"&8This is not legal advice. The Company may not be held liable for any and all Franchisee malpractice and mistreatment.&r"
